436
00:19:00,150 --> 00:19:01,980
during the Obama administration,

437
00:19:01,980 --> 00:19:05,700
this call to reshape government from the inside,

438
00:19:05,700 --> 00:19:07,650
go do your tour of duty.

439
00:19:07,650 --> 00:19:09,750
It's not enough to just vote,

440
00:19:09,750 --> 00:19:13,560
and you know, complain about the situation.

441
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:16,710
What might you be able to do crossing a bridge

442
00:19:16,710 --> 00:19:19,830
to another sector, another discipline, etcetera.

443
00:19:19,830 --> 00:19:22,110
So I think in short, the answer is yes.

444
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:25,200
At Berkeley we're seeing, you know, the continued trend

445
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:27,690
of our data science foundational class

446
00:19:27,690 --> 00:19:32,220
