447
00:19:32,220 --> 00:19:33,780
Seeing the applicability

448
00:19:33,780 --> 00:19:38,610
of the data skills, the AI increasingly,

449
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:42,690
literacy skills that were mentioned at the summit,

450
00:19:42,690 --> 00:19:46,443
all going into a lot of different career paths.

451
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:50,280
I do have some numbers in case

452
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:52,800
those in the audience we're tracking.

453
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:54,540
I was asked, you know,

454
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:59,160
how many community colleges are partnering directly

455
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:01,830
