460
00:20:13,950 --> 00:20:16,590
for our foundational data science course.

461
00:20:16,590 --> 00:20:19,980
And 27 California community colleges

462
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:24,980
are using our interactive computing infrastructure.

463
00:20:25,050 --> 00:20:26,880
And so the combination

464
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:30,360
