465
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:31,860
where it's like, no pressure,

466
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:34,350
here's, you know, this material online.

467
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:37,980
By the way, it's been, you know, vetted from a community.

468
00:20:37,980 --> 00:20:40,140
It continues to evolve with.

469
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:41,910
