478
00:21:03,690 --> 00:21:07,290
and important in a multidisciplinary multi-sector

479
00:21:07,290 --> 00:21:10,170
AI ready workforce frame.

480
00:21:10,170 --> 00:21:13,620
So I'm really excited about seeing this data.

481
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:16,680
And of course, as a data science geek,

