oh, and what might we do with the larger sample

484
00:21:19,710 --> 00:21:21,330
and the 39 million Californians

485
00:21:21,330 --> 00:21:22,800
and what could we, you know,

486
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:24,393
continue to learn together?

487
00:21:27,775 --> 00:21:29,370
- Thank you Meredith, and thank you for pioneering

488
00:21:29,370 --> 00:21:30,630
